# security plugins (login throttling, password-policy enforcers) that hook
# the native register/login flow. The runtime gate is
# SD_AI_AGENT_FEATURE_USER_MANAGEMENT (forced false in the wporg build by
# bin/build.sh); the file strip below is defence-in-depth so the surface is
# physically absent from the submitted zip. The read-only
# sd-ai-agent/list-users ability lives in UserAbilities.php and is
# unaffected — that file is NOT stripped.
